### SLP — Buyer (rodar com ./mvnw mn:run; porta 8081)
### Cenário do enunciado: vendedor A $20 (seller) · comprador B $10 (sem match) · comprador C $30 (match a $25)

### 1) Comprador B oferece $10 → 202 + Location
POST http://localhost:8081/buy-offers
Content-Type: application/json

< ./compra-b-10.json

> {% client.global.set("offerB", response.body.offerId); %}

### 2) Comprador C oferece $30 → 202 + Location
POST http://localhost:8081/buy-offers
Content-Type: application/json

< ./compra-c-30.json

> {% client.global.set("offerC", response.body.offerId); %}

### 3) Consultar lance B → PENDING (não há venda <= 10)
GET http://localhost:8081/buy-offers/{{offerB}}

### 4) Consultar lance C → PENDING até o coordinator juntar com a venda de $20; depois EXECUTED a 25.000
GET http://localhost:8081/buy-offers/{{offerC}}

### 5) Preço inválido (3 casas) → 400 problem+json
POST http://localhost:8081/buy-offers
Content-Type: application/json

< ./compra-invalida.json

### 6) Oferta inexistente → 404 OFFER_NOT_FOUND
GET http://localhost:8081/buy-offers/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
